{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:57:34+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-23T15:57:34+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Wacker Neuson SE","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Farm & Heavy Construction Machinery","country":"Germany","city":"Munich","website":"https://wackerneusongroup.com","employees":5757,"summary":"Wacker Neuson SE manufactures and distributes light and compact equipment in Germany, Austria, the United States, and internationally. It operates in three segments: Light Equipment, Compact Equipment, and Services. The company provides battery-powered rammers, vibratory plates and rollers for soil compaction, internal vibrators for concrete compaction, and mini excavators, as well as charging solutions. It also offers compact equipment, including track and wheeled excavators, wheel loaders, tele wheel loaders, skid steer loaders, telehandlers, wheel and track dumpers, and backhoe loaders, as well as related product attachments and accessories. In addition, the company provides repair and maintenance services; spare parts; used equipment, financing, telematics, training, e-business, and rental solutions; and digital service solutions. Further, it offers demolition and lighting products, pumps, heaters, generators, farm loaders, articulated wheels, and interchangeable batteries and chargers. Additionally, the company is involved in the sale of third-party machines, including resale of trade-ins. It distributes its products and services under the Wacker Neuson, Kramer, Weidemann, Enar, BatteryOne, and Sequello brand names. The company serves construction, gardening and landscaping, agricultural, municipal, recycling, railway, and manufacturing industries. Wacker Neuson SE was founded in 1848 and is headquartered in Munich, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Wacker Neuson SE fabrique et distribue des équipements légers et compacts en Allemagne, en Autriche, aux États-Unis et à l'international. Elle opère sur trois segments : les équipements légers, les équipements compacts et les services. La société fournit des percuteurs à piles, des plaques et des rouleaux vibrants pour le compactage du sol, des vibrateurs internes pour le compactage du béton et des mini-pelles, ainsi que des solutions de charge."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":1530345216,"shares_outstanding":68015345,"trailing_pe":13.00578,"forward_pe":10.869092,"price_to_book":0.9921947,"ev_to_ebitda":8.473,"ev_to_revenue":0.76,"dividend_yield":0.030299999,"payout_ratio":0.4046,"beta_yahoo":1.205},"targets":{"current_price":22.5,"mean":23.5,"median":23.5,"high":29.0,"low":18.0,"n_analysts":3,"reco_mean":3.0,"reco_key":"hold"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-12"],"eps_avg":0.42,"eps_low":0.42,"eps_high":0.42,"revenue_avg":598000000,"ex_dividend":"2026-05-14","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.5747,"institutions_pct":0.10847,"institutions_float_pct":0.25503,"institutions_n":82,"institutions":[],"funds":[{"name":"DFA INVESTMENT DIMENSIONS GROUP INC-DFA Intl Small Cap Value PORT.","pct":0.0101,"shares":689817,"value":15520882,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0},{"name":"American Century ETF Trust-Avantis International Small Cap Value ETF","pct":0.008,"shares":541208,"value":12177180,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.1566},{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.006,"shares":406296,"value":9141660,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0038,"shares":261498,"value":5883705,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0037,"shares":254730,"value":5731425,"date":"2026-08-31","chg":0.0053},{"name":"DFA INVESTMENT TRUST CO-The Continental Small Company Series","pct":0.0032,"shares":216450,"value":4870125,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.042600002},{